_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111726","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111726.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111726.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100567\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112757\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112758\r\n\r\nAt the root of this issue is that any `Control` sets a custom rect in `NOTIFICATION_DRAW` for the renderer that was only ever as big as its own bounds (Position at (0, 0) and size of the control) causing it to ignore all draw commands due to this guard:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/20430236e749306e1968656ffdc7f78e502a0ccc/servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_render.cpp#L37-L39\r\n\r\nNow the control node merges its own size rect with the draw command rect if applicable.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111726/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111726/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}